{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Cleanup job queues"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"cleanup","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"pendingJobs","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"JobCleanup","preciseIdentifier":"s:12JobsPostgres0B8JobQueueC0C7CleanupV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.opticalaberration.hummingbird\/documentation\/JobsPostgres\/PostgresJobQueue\/JobCleanup"},{"text":" = .doNothing, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"processingJobs","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"JobCleanup","preciseIdentifier":"s:12JobsPostgres0B8JobQueueC0C7CleanupV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.opticalaberration.hummingbird\/documentation\/JobsPostgres\/PostgresJobQueue\/JobCleanup"},{"text":" = .doNothing, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"completedJobs","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"JobCleanup","preciseIdentifier":"s:12JobsPostgres0B8JobQueueC0C7CleanupV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.opticalaberration.hummingbird\/documentation\/JobsPostgres\/PostgresJobQueue\/JobCleanup"},{"text":" = .doNothing, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"failedJobs","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"JobCleanup","preciseIdentifier":"s:12JobsPostgres0B8JobQueueC0C7CleanupV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.opticalaberration.hummingbird\/documentation\/JobsPostgres\/PostgresJobQueue\/JobCleanup"},{"text":" = .doNothing, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"cancelledJobs","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"JobCleanup","preciseIdentifier":"s:12JobsPostgres0B8JobQueueC0C7CleanupV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.opticalaberration.hummingbird\/documentation\/JobsPostgres\/PostgresJobQueue\/JobCleanup"},{"text":" = .doNothing, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"pausedJobs","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"JobCleanup","preciseIdentifier":"s:12JobsPostgres0B8JobQueueC0C7CleanupV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.opticalaberration.hummingbird\/documentation\/JobsPostgres\/PostgresJobQueue\/JobCleanup"},{"text":" = .doNothing, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"logger","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Logger","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Logging6LoggerV"},{"text":"? = nil) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This function is used to re-run or delete jobs in a certain state. Failed, completed,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cancelled and paused jobs can be pushed back into the pending queue to be re-run or removed.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"When called at startup in theory no job should be set to processing, or set to pending but","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not in the queue. but if your job server crashes these states are possible, so we also provide","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"options to re-queue these jobs so they are run again.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can call "},{"code":"cleanup","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with "},{"code":"failedJobs","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"completedJobs","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"cancelledJobs","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"code":"pausedJobs","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" set"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to whatever you like at any point to re-queue failed jobs. Moving processing or pending jobs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"should only be done if you are certain there is nothing processing the job queue."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"pendingJobs: What to do with jobs tagged as pending","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"processingJobs: What to do with jobs tagged as processing"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"completedJobs: What to do with jobs tagged as completed"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"failedJobs: What to do with jobs tagged as failed"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"cancelledJobs: What to do with jobs tagged as cancelled","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"pausedJobs: What to do with jobs tagged as paused"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"logger: Optional logger to use when performing cleanup","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Throws","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"sections":[],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:12JobsPostgres0B8JobQueueC7cleanup07pendingA0010processingA009completedA006failedA009cancelledA006pausedA06loggeryAC0C7CleanupV_A5M7Logging6LoggerVSgtYaKF","modules":[{"name":"JobsPostgres"}],"role":"symbol","title":"cleanup(pendingJobs:processingJobs:completedJobs:failedJobs:cancelledJobs:pausedJobs:logger:)","extendedModule":"JobsPostgres","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"cleanup"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"pendingJobs"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12JobsPostgres0